{"headword":"אָכַל","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. eat (</strong>Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">أَكَلَ</span>, As. <em>akâlu</em> Dl<sup>W</sup>, Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲכַל</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܶܟܰܠ</span> <strong>)</strong>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אָכַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:28\" href=\"/Exodus.34.28\">Ex 34:28</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">אָֽכְלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:28\" href=\"/Numbers.21.28\">Nu 21:28</a> +, etc. Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹאכַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:27\" href=\"/Genesis.49.27\">Gn 49:27</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיֹּא֫כַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:34\" href=\"/Genesis.25.34\">Gn 25:34</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיֹּאכַ֑ל</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:6\" href=\"/Genesis.3.6\">Gn 3:6</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹאכֵ֑ל</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 21:22\" href=\"/Leviticus.21.22\">Lv 21:22</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹכַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:33\" href=\"/Genesis.24.33\">Gn 24:33</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">וָֽאֹכַ֫ל</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:33\" href=\"/Genesis.27.33\">27:33</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְאֹכֵ֑ל</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.19\">Is 44:19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וָֽאֹכֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:12\" href=\"/Genesis.3.12\">Gn 3:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:13\" href=\"/Genesis.3.13\">13</a>; 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹאכְלוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:33\" href=\"/Genesis.32.33\">Gn 32:33</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹאכֵ֑לוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 18:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.18.8\">Dt 18:8</a> +; etc. (for <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹכְלוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.5\">Ez 42:5</a> rd. <span dir=\"rtl\">יוצלו</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יאצלו</span> 𝔊 Ew Co); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹאכְלֶנּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:6\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.6\">Lv 7:6</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּאכַלְכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.3